-+## Changed
-+
-+- New `src/core/status/show-land-types.ts` holds the Ports types (`LandGateKind`,
-+  `LandGate`, `LandDisclosure`, `LandView`).
-+- New `src/core/status/show-land-model.ts` exports `readLandView`, which returns
-+  null unless `details.location` is `archived` and otherwise builds the land
-+  view from the details it is given: archive gates from `details.timeline` at
-+  or before the last `archived` event (last per-task `verify_ran` without a
-+  `phase`, then the proposal verify, then the declared `check`, then the
-+  validator), `capabilities` from `readArchivedChange` for the change's own
-+  archived entry, disclosures from `readChangeDisclosures`, halt from
-+  `.run/regressed/change.md` via `parseFrontmatter`, last sync from
-+  `readLastSync`, and — through `selectVcs` — `defaultBranch`,
-+  `readDependencyState` (landed), `countCommits` and `diffStat` for
-+  `worktreeBranch(folderName)`; with git off all four git fields are null.
-+  It writes nothing.
-+- New `src/core/status/show-land-lines.ts` exports `landLines(details)`,
-+  rendering the `Land:` headline, `Gates at archive:`, `Diff:`, `Spec changes:`,
-+  `Disclosures:`, `Halted:` and `Sync stopped:` lines; it imports no `node:fs`
-+  and, per the renderer import test, only `show-types`.
-+- `src/core/status/show-types.ts`: `SpecDetails` gains `land?: LandView`.
-+- `src/core/status/show-model.ts`: `withNextStep` sets `land` from
-+  `readLandView` for an archived folder, so `formatShowJson` carries it before
-+  `digest`.
-+- `src/core/status/show-output.ts`: `formatShowText` appends the land lines
-+  after `formatSpecDetails` and before the digest lines.
-+- `src/core/web/web-data-types.ts`: `WebChange` gains `readonly land?:
-+  LandView | null`.
-+- `src/core/web/web-data-change.ts`: `getWebChange` always sets `land` from
-+  `readLandView` with the details it already builds.
