+## Changed
+
+- New `src/core/status/show-land-types.ts` holds the Ports types
+  (`LandGateKind`, `LandGate`, `LandDisclosure`, `LandHalt`, `LandView`).
+- New `src/core/status/show-land-model.ts` exports `readLandView`, which
+  returns null unless `details.location` is `archived` and otherwise builds
+  the view from files and refs osq already writes: archive gates from
+  `details.timeline` at or before the last `archived` event (last per-task
+  `verify_ran` without a `phase`, then the proposal `verify`, then the
+  declared `check:`, then `validator_ran`), `capabilities` from
+  `readArchivedChange` for the `listChanges(projectRoot, config, ['archived'])`
+  entry whose path resolves to `details.folderPath`, disclosures from
